{"id": "191178", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – נפח מתחת לפרבולואיד אליפטי", "defaultgrade": 2, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_V2\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">נפח מתחת לפרבולואיד אליפטי</div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div>חשבו את נפח הגוף הנמצא מעל מישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle xy\\)</span> ומתחת לפרבולואיד</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;margin:8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle z={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n[[jsxgraph]]\nvar board=JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid,{boundingbox:[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}},{{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}],axis:true,showCopyright:false,keepaspectratio:true});\nboard.create('curve',[function(t){return {{CT:5}}+Math.sqrt({{CT:6}})*Math.cos(t);},function(t){return {{CT:7}}+Math.sqrt({{CT:8}})*Math.sin(t);},0,2*Math.PI],{fillOpacity:0.22});\n[[/jsxgraph]]</div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">התשובה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle V=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:7px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:7px;\">הזינו ערך מדויק. אפשר להקליד <span dir=\"ltr\">%pi</span> עבור \\(\\displaystyle \\pi\\).</div></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>ההטלה על מישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle xy\\)</span> היא האליפסה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:9}}\\left(x-{{CT:10}}\\right)^2+{{CT:11}}\\left(y-{{CT:12}}\\right)^2\\le {{CT:13}}\\)</div>\n<p>נשתמש בהחלפת המשתנים האליפטית</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:14}},\\qquad y={{CT:15}},\\qquad 0\\le r\\le1,\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi\\)</div>\n<p>אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle z={{CT:16}}\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle |J|={{CT:17}}\\)</span>, ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle V=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{2\\pi}{{CT:18}}\\,d\\theta\\,dr={{CT:19}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 22, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"